        {
          "id": 687029060,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Needs further work. If text is cleared in filter edit line (but not applied) it's passed to follow as the current filter.  \n  \n[main_window_slots.cpp](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/ui/qt/main_window_slots.cpp#L2930): void MainWindow::openFollowStreamDialog()  \n`        fsd->follow(getFilter());`  \n  \n[main_window.cpp](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/ui/qt/main_window.cpp#L729): QString MainWindow::getFilter()  \n`    return df_combo_box_->currentText();`\n\n`follow()` should be called with `last_applied` ???",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0809ffc6d9d98013a1895132bc055c622830b8a20bfa49328f53d5eb4a1206cb?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/chuckcraft"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-09-25T18:12:15.590Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-09-25T23:37:49.369Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 118417211,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 4297,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 687052878,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The text in df_combo_box is not a filter until it has been checked and applied.  \nMove getFilter() to display_filter_edit.cpp and return the last applied/valid display filter.  \n  \nAnother spot where it can cause an issue in [filter_action.cpp](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/ui/qt/filter_action.cpp)\n```\n        if (qobject_cast<MainWindow *>(mainWin))\n            filterEmpty = qobject_cast<MainWindow *>(mainWin)->getFilter().isEmpty();\n```\n  \nEnter any string in the display filter edit line and right click a packet to add a filter. The bogus text is include as being the previous filter.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0809ffc6d9d98013a1895132bc055c622830b8a20bfa49328f53d5eb4a1206cb?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/chuckcraft"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-09-25T23:37:49.316Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-09-25T23:37:49.316Z",
